{"unit_id":"Icestab__dsh-image-vision-bridge#card-zh","repo":"Icestab/dsh-image-vision-bridge","commit":"61b3602e4d4878445f167c68f916c2053c8c122b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-vision-bridge 是面向 DSH Web profile 的图片理解插件：它监听 llm/stream 请求，在图片发送给文本模型前调用配置的视觉模型生成描述，再用描述替换请求中的图片块。插件递归处理 tool-result 中的图片，保留聊天记录和原请求，缓存描述并限制注入长度；视觉调用失败时生成提示文本。适合需要让文本模型回答截图、照片或图表内容的场景。默认使用 opencode-go 路由上的 mimo-v2.5，需配置可用的视觉模型路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:110-138","lib/index.js:173-215","lib/index.js:224-239","cordis.patch.yml:4-9"]}
{"unit_id":"Icestab__dsh-image-vision-bridge#card-en","repo":"Icestab/dsh-image-vision-bridge","commit":"61b3602e4d4878445f167c68f916c2053c8c122b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-image-vision-bridge helps DSH text models understand images. It calls a configured vision model, replaces image blocks with descriptions, preserves chat content, and handles nested tool results. Descriptions are cached; failures produce a fallback. Defaults to opencode-go and mimo-v2.5.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:110-138","lib/index.js:173-215","lib/index.js:224-239","cordis.patch.yml:4-9"]}
