{"unit_id":"Icestab__dsh-image-vision-bridge#feature-1","repo":"Icestab/dsh-image-vision-bridge","commit":"61b3602e4d4878445f167c68f916c2053c8c122b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-vision-bridge 的功能「图片转文字描述」：遇到含图片的模型请求时调用视觉模型生成描述，再将图片块替换为描述文本。此过程在 llm/stream 请求中自动触发，描述随重写后的消息传给主模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:110-138","lib/index.js:209-231"]}
{"unit_id":"Icestab__dsh-image-vision-bridge#feature-2","repo":"Icestab/dsh-image-vision-bridge","commit":"61b3602e4d4878445f167c68f916c2053c8c122b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-vision-bridge 的功能「递归处理工具结果图片」：检查消息内容中的 tool-result 嵌套块，并将其中图片也改写为视觉描述文本。请求中自动触发，不修改原消息对象。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:173-203","lib/index.js:209-215"]}
{"unit_id":"Icestab__dsh-image-vision-bridge#feature-3","repo":"Icestab/dsh-image-vision-bridge","commit":"61b3602e4d4878445f167c68f916c2053c8c122b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-vision-bridge 的功能「缓存图片描述」：根据图片附件 id 组合缓存键，在进程内复用成功描述或失败结果，避免重试和后续轮次重复调用视觉模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:91-99","lib/index.js:145-157"]}
{"unit_id":"Icestab__dsh-image-vision-bridge#feature-4","repo":"Icestab/dsh-image-vision-bridge","commit":"61b3602e4d4878445f167c68f916c2053c8c122b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-vision-bridge 的功能「失败时提供文字回退」：视觉模型调用异常或未返回文本时，将失败说明作为图片描述块交给主模型；请求取消仍会向外抛出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:137-138","lib/index.js:145-157","lib/index.js:160-167"]}
